From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mason Freed <masonf@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add fast paths for runs of plain characters

Read ahead from the source instead of reading it one byte at a time, and
append runs of plain ASCII characters in attribute values, names and
character data directly to the corresponding buffers, instead of
tokenizing and dispatching every character individually. Events, errors
and positions are unchanged.

Upstream PR (not merged yet): https://github.com/kornelski/xml-rs/pull/97
---
